          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le texte inséré est traduit en anglais."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The language of menus and settings. Relaunch to apply.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La langue des menus et des réglages. Relancez pour appliquer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The last words recognised": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les derniers mots reconnus"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The microphone isn't allowed yet, so nothing will be heard. Go back a step to allow it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le micro n'est pas encore autorisé, donc rien ne sera entendu. Revenez une étape en arrière pour l'autoriser."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model chosen for this site is forgotten.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le modèle choisi pour ce site est oublié."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model didn't load": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le modèle ne s'est pas chargé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model didn't return a usable translation, so your text was kept. Small models struggle with this; Ollama or a remote model handles it reliably.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le modèle n'a pas renvoyé de traduction exploitable ; votre texte a été conservé. Les petits modèles peinent sur cette tâche ; Ollama ou un modèle distant s'en sort de façon fiable."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model is built into macOS: downloaded per language by the system, shared across apps and updated with the OS. Nothing is stored in the app. Using a language here also sets the spoken language. macOS keeps up to 5 languages per app and rotates them beyond that.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le modèle est intégré à macOS : téléchargé par langue par le système, partagé entre les apps et mis à jour avec l'OS. Rien n'est stocké dans l'app. Utiliser une langue ici règle aussi la langue parlée. macOS conserve jusqu'à 5 langues par app et les fait tourner au-delà."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model that turns your voice into text. Everything runs on this Mac unless you pick a server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le modèle qui transforme votre voix en texte. Tout tourne sur ce Mac, sauf si vous choisissez un serveur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The punctuation came back already written, so there was nothing standing in for it. That usually means the model is doing it for you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La ponctuation est revenue déjà écrite, il n'y avait donc rien à sa place. Cela signifie généralement que le modèle la gère pour vous."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The recommendation follows your language.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La recommandation suit votre langue."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The right Option key": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La touche Option de droite"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The right model to start with.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le bon modèle pour commencer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server's models are listed here after a successful Test Connection — most providers (e.g. Groq) need the API key set first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les modèles du serveur s'affichent ici après un test de connexion réussi ; la plupart des fournisseurs (Groq par ex.) demandent d'abord la clé API."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The snippet's name before it is inserted": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le nom du snippet avant son insertion"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The words land wherever the cursor is: here, or in any other app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les mots arrivent là où se trouve le curseur : ici, ou dans n'importe quelle autre app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then the agent goes back to its terminal, where you can still answer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Puis l'agent retourne à son terminal, où vous pouvez toujours répondre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These record only while held and stop when released, whatever Hold to record says. Pair a shortcut above with a held key here, like Right ⌥ Option.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ceux-ci n'enregistrent que tant qu'ils sont maintenus et s'arrêtent au relâchement, quel que soit le réglage Maintenir pour enregistrer. Associez un raccourci ci-dessus à une touche maintenue ici, comme ⌥ Option droite."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This pattern is not a valid regular expression: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce motif n'est pas une expression régulière valide : %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tiếng Việt": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tiếng Việt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To dictate": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour dicter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To hear you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour vous entendre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To notice right ⌥ while another app is in front. macOS asks once, when the app starts listening for the key. Only modifier keys are watched.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour remarquer ⌥ droite quand une autre app est au premier plan. macOS le demande une fois, quand l'app commence à écouter la touche. Seules les touches de modification sont surveillées."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To type your words into other apps.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour taper vos mots dans les autres apps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Today": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aujourd'hui"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Together these two are the entire system prompt, nothing is added around them. The closing half stays the model's last word, after any app rule. A small model tends to answer in the language the prompt is written in, so write it in the language you dictate.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À elles deux, elles constituent l'intégralité de l'invite système, rien n'est ajouté autour. La partie finale reste le dernier mot adressé au modèle, après toute règle d'app. Un petit modèle a tendance à répondre dans la langue de l'invite, alors rédigez-la dans la langue que vous dictez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Top right": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En haut à droite"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Transcribe": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transcrire"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Transcribe audio files": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transcrire des fichiers audio"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Transcribes on this Mac when the server can't be reached.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transcrit sur ce Mac quand le serveur est injoignable."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Transcription": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transcription"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Transcriptions folder": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dossier des transcriptions"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Translate to English is on, but no Whisper model is downloaded, and only Whisper translates. Download one under Whisper.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Traduire en anglais est activé, mais aucun modèle Whisper n'est téléchargé, et seul Whisper traduit. Téléchargez-en un sous Whisper."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Translate to English is on, so only Whisper models are offered. Parakeet and SenseVoice can't translate.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Traduire en anglais est activé, donc seuls les modèles Whisper sont proposés. Parakeet et SenseVoice ne savent pas traduire."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Transparent glass on the window and the bubble.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verre transparent sur la fenêtre et la bulle."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Transparent glass on the window and the bubble. macOS 26 and later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verre transparent sur la fenêtre et la bulle. macOS 26 et ultérieur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try a beta build": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Essayer une version bêta"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turbo models don't translate, whatever their documentation says. Pick a non-turbo Whisper model to translate.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les modèles turbo ne traduisent pas, quoi qu'en dise leur documentation. Choisissez un modèle Whisper non turbo pour traduire."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on Claude Code or Codex above to choose when the panel shows.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activez Claude Code ou Codex ci-dessus pour choisir quand le panneau s'affiche."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on Live text (Parakeet) to use it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activez Texte en direct (Parakeet) pour l'utiliser."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turns the system volume down while you dictate.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Baisse le volume du système pendant que vous dictez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type a sentence to try": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapez une phrase pour essayer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type directly into the app": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Taper directement dans l'app"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Types": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Frappe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Types, %lld ms": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Frappe, %lld ms"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Typing pace": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rythme de frappe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Understands your language well. Runs on this Mac, no account needed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comprend bien votre langue. Tourne sur ce Mac, sans compte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unencrypted http:// unless you type https://.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "http:// non chiffré, sauf si vous tapez https://."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unloads the Whisper model (about 1 GB) between dictations and reloads it when you dictate. Saves memory, adds a little delay at the start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Décharge le modèle Whisper (environ 1 Go) entre les dictées et le recharge quand vous dictez. Économise de la mémoire, ajoute un léger délai au démarrage."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Updates, release notes, and where to tell us what works and what doesn't.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mises à jour, notes de version, et où nous dire ce qui marche et ce qui ne marche pas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utiliser"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use a remote server": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utiliser un serveur distant"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use beam search": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utiliser la recherche en faisceau"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use the dictionary": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utiliser le dictionnaire"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use the text around the cursor": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utiliser le texte autour du curseur"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Version"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@. Star it, read it, open a pull request.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Version %@. Ajoutez une étoile, lisez le code, ouvrez une pull request."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Voice commands": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Commandes vocales"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Volume while dictating": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Volume pendant la dictée"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wait for an answer": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Attendre une réponse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wants to use **%@**": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Veut utiliser **%@**"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warn when no field is focused": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avertir quand aucun champ n'est actif"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waveform height": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hauteur de la forme d'onde"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waveform style": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Style de forme d'onde"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We can't confirm this server's model supports translation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Impossible de confirmer que le modèle de ce serveur gère la traduction."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What OpenSuperWhisper keeps on your Mac, and for how long.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce qu'OpenSuperWhisper conserve sur votre Mac, et pendant combien de temps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What happens to the text between your voice and the app: cleanup, formatting, insertion.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce qui arrive au texte entre votre voix et l'app : nettoyage, mise en forme, insertion."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What's new": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nouveautés"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When it matches": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand il correspond"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When off, what you had copied before is put back after the paste.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactivé, ce que vous aviez copié avant est remis en place après le collage."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the front app changes. Bind a model to an app below, or from the menu-bar “Model” submenu.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand l'app au premier plan change. Associez un modèle à une app ci-dessous, ou depuis le sous-menu « Modèle » de la barre de menus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the model writes": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand le modèle écrit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When translating": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lors de la traduction"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where you drop it": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Là où vous la déposez"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which regional model transcribes the selected language. Spelling and numbers follow it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le modèle régional qui transcrit la langue choisie. L'orthographe et les nombres en dépendent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While dictating": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pendant la dictée"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While recording, Space (or a double tap of the shortcut) keeps it going so you can let go. Space again stops it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pendant l'enregistrement, Espace (ou un double appui sur le raccourci) le maintient pour que vous puissiez lâcher. Espace à nouveau l'arrête."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whisper": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Whisper"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whole word only": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mot entier uniquement"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whole-word replacement, case-insensitive. Write \\n in a replacement for a line break.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remplacement de mots entiers, insensible à la casse. Écrivez \\n dans un remplacement pour un saut de ligne."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Width of the drawn notch on screens without one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Largeur de l'encoche dessinée sur les écrans qui n'en ont pas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Will be chosen on the Style page.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sera choisi sur la page Style."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without a scheme, plain http:// (unencrypted) is used. Type https:// for TLS.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sans schéma, http:// simple (non chiffré) est utilisé. Tapez https:// pour TLS."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without it, the shortcuts don't work outside the app and the text can't be typed where you write.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sans elle, les raccourcis ne fonctionnent pas hors de l'app et le texte ne peut pas être tapé là où vous écrivez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Words": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mots"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Words appear while you speak.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les mots apparaissent pendant que vous parlez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Words or style the model should expect. Whisper copies its style, so a few lines of your own writing teach it your punctuation. A file at ~/.config/opensuperwhisper/prompt.md replaces this box when it exists.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mots ou style que le modèle doit attendre. Whisper reprend son style, donc quelques lignes de votre propre écriture lui apprennent votre ponctuation. Un fichier ~/.config/opensuperwhisper/prompt.md remplace ce champ s'il existe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Words you correct by hand will be suggested here": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
